		"description": "<p><strong>Passive Effect:</strong> You gain resistance to one damage type of choice between fire, cold, lightning and poison. The choice is permanent.</p><p><strong>Active Effect:</strong> You can also choose to infuse any weapon you’re proficient in with a few drops of your blood. The weapon thus infused will deal 1d8 extra damage of the type you’re resistant to. You can only have one infused weapon at any time.</p>",
